{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pre-Odyssey: Love at First Quack",
    "steam_appid": 3574770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574770/extras/7d2f8d49c49a9bb8b203e6a4a9534256.avif?t=1750413216\" width=420 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Helen of Sparta is the most beautiful woman in the world, coveted by almost all the kings and princes of Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Suitors from far and wide have flocked to their palace in hopes of winning her hand in marriage-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026But this isn\u2019t about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Penelope, Helen\u2019s less popular cousin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying at her uncle's palace, she encounters one of Helen's supposed suitors, the notorious 'trickster king', Odysseus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this Spartan princess is also notorious in her own right...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... As the favorite daughter of Prince Icarius?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, not that one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I mean, as the notorious <i>'duck girl'</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This story is based on the Oath of Tyndareus, and a couple of other myths centering on Penelope and Odysseus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574770/extras/ad2062cc671a06d835ec5b58afbc0c04.avif?t=1750413216\" width=420 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35k+ Words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck puns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Love interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Good endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Friendship endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of quacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ CGs to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore/trivias to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ducks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574770/extras/7d2f8d49c49a9bb8b203e6a4a9534256.avif?t=1750413216\" width=420 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Helen of Sparta is the most beautiful woman in the world, coveted by almost all the kings and princes of Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Suitors from far and wide have flocked to their palace in hopes of winning her hand in marriage-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026But this isn\u2019t about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Penelope, Helen\u2019s less popular cousin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying at her uncle's palace, she encounters one of Helen's supposed suitors, the notorious 'trickster king', Odysseus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this Spartan princess is also notorious in her own right...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... As the favorite daughter of Prince Icarius?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, not that one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I mean, as the notorious <i>'duck girl'</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This story is based on the Oath of Tyndareus, and a couple of other myths centering on Penelope and Odysseus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574770/extras/ad2062cc671a06d835ec5b58afbc0c04.avif?t=1750413216\" width=420 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35k+ Words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duck puns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Love interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Good endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Friendship endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of quacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ CGs to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore/trivias to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Voice Acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ducks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "She\u2019s a princess beloved by ducks. He\u2019s a notorious king of schemes. A romantic fragment from a 3000-year old EPIC, retold as an Otome visual novel\u2026 but with ducks somehow added to the mix.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cPre-Odyssey completely charmed me from start to finish! As a huge fan of Greek mythology, I was instantly intrigued by the premise, and I\u2019m so happy to say it didn\u2019t disappoint. The mix of myth, romance, and comedy (yes, including the ducks\ud83e\udd86) was so unique and refreshing. It\u2019s the kind of game that makes you smile the whole way through. If you\u2019re looking for a short but sweet otome game with a mythological twist, this is a hidden gem worth quacking about.\u201d<br />\r\n9 \u2013 Otomeaddicted<br />\r\n",
